<title>NETHERLANDS: Getronics details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Getronics details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Getronics NV said on Friday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 180 held.</p>
<p>On February 28 the company announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 0.30 guilders, up from 0.25 in 1995, or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Getronics shares closed at 56.60 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
